<title>USA: East Penn School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>East Penn School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The East Penn School District, Pa., said Monday it recalculated Janney Montgomery Scott Inc's winning bid on the District $10 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.575 percent reflecting the cost of insurance, not the 5.556 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
